<title>USA: Sikorsky hurt by Clinton budget - US Senator.</title>
<headline>Sikorsky hurt by Clinton budget - US Senator.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sikorsky Aircraft, a unit of United Technologies Corp., could lose up to 1,000 jobs in Connecticut as a result of President Clinton's proposed defense budget, Connecticut U.S. Senator Joe Lieberman said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The one problem we have, and this is a very serious matter for us, is that this budget only supports 18 Blackhawk helicopters at Sikorsky,&quot; Lieberman, a Democrat, said in a statement.</p>
<p>Officials at Sikorsky and United Technologies were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
